---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Icons from "../../components/Icons.astro";
import Breadcrumb from "../../components/Breadcrumb.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Badaling vs Mutianyu Great Wall: Which Section to Visit?" description="Mutianyu or Badaling? Compare crowds, difficulty, scenery, distance from Beijing, and ticket prices. Honest breakdown to pick the right Great Wall section.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: "Compare", href: "/#compare-guides" }, { label: "Badaling vs Mutianyu" }]} />
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-6 pb-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-900 mb-6">Badaling vs Mutianyu: Which Great Wall Should You Visit?</h1>
    <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-accent pl-4 py-2 mb-8 bg-accent-bg/30 rounded-r">
      <p class="text-base text-base-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>The short answer:</strong> For first-time visitors who want the iconic postcard view and don't mind crowds, pick Badaling. For families, photographers, and anyone who values a relaxed experience over the classic photo, go Mutianyu. If you're still unsure after reading this guide, Mutianyu is the safer bet - we've sent dozens of friends and family there and nobody has ever come back disappointed.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Side-by-Side Comparison</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-base-200 rounded-lg">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-base-100 text-base-500 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">
          <tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">Feature</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">Badaling</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">Mutianyu</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Distance from City</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">70km (~1.5 hours)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">75km (~1.5 hours)</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Crowd Level</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Very crowded</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Moderate</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Scenery</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Dramatic, steep mountains</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Lush forest, gentler slopes</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Cable Car</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Yes (round trip)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Yes + toboggan slide down</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Ticket Price</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">CNY 35-40</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">CNY 40-45</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Best for Kids</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Difficult (steep sections)</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Good (gentler, toboggan)</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Photo Ops</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Classic postcard views</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Fewer people in frame</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-700">Access</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Train S2 + shuttle bus</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Bus 916 Express + taxi</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Which One Is Right for You?</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><Icons name="users" size={20} class="text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" /><div><strong class="text-base-900">Traveling with kids or elderly parents?</strong><p class="text-sm text-base-600 mt-1">Pick Mutianyu. The paths are wider, slopes gentler, and the toboggan slide is a hit with children. You can also take the cable car both ways.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><Icons name="map-pin" size={20} class="text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" /><div><strong class="text-base-900">First time in China, want the iconic experience?</strong><p class="text-sm text-base-600 mt-1">Pick Badaling. It's the classic Great Wall experience that appears in every guidebook and photo. The scale and drama are unmatched.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><Icons name="star" size={20} class="text-accent mt-0.5 shrink-0" /><div><strong class="text-base-900">Photographer or hate crowds?</strong><p class="text-sm text-base-600 mt-1">Pick Mutianyu. You'll get beautiful shots without dozens of strangers in them. Arrive early for the best light.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-12">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Detailed Guides</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a href="/attractions/great-wall-badaling/" class="card group block p-5">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-900 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-1">Great Wall at Badaling</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500">Complete guide: tickets, transport, best times</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/attractions/great-wall-mutianyu/" class="card group block p-5">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-900 group-hover:text-accent transition-colors mb-1">Great Wall at Mutianyu</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-500">Complete guide: toboggan, cable car, routes</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">The Experience: What It Actually Feels Like</h2>
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-900 mb-2">Badaling: Grand, Dramatic, Crowded</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-600 leading-relaxed">As you approach Badaling, the Wall appears on the mountain ridge like something out of a movie - sheer and imposing, snaking over peaks so steep you wonder how anyone built it. The Wall here is wide (5-6 meters in places) and meticulously restored. On a clear day, the views are genuinely breathtaking. But from about 10am onward, the wide paths fill with tour groups, selfie sticks, and vendors selling "I Climbed the Great Wall" t-shirts. The north side is a steady stream of humanity; the energy is electric but not peaceful. Expect to share every watchtower with 30-50 other people.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-5">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-base-900 mb-2">Mutianyu: Green, Serene, Fun</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-600 leading-relaxed">Mutianyu feels like a different world. The Wall emerges from dense forest - in summer, it's a sea of green; in autumn, gold and crimson. The paths are slightly narrower than Badaling but feel more intimate. The 23 watchtowers are close together, giving you frequent places to stop, rest, and take in the view without feeling rushed. Even on a busy Saturday in October, you'll find stretches where you're the only person in sight. The toboggan slide at the end is a genuinely exhilarating 1,580-meter ride through the forest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Practicalities: Getting There and Back</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-accent font-semibold shrink-0 w-20 text-sm">Badaling</span><div><p class="text-sm text-base-600 leading-relaxed">Take the S2 train from Beijing North Station (one hour, CNY 6) or the 877 bus from Deshengmen (90 minutes, CNY 12). Both are straightforward and cheap. By private car, budget CNY 500-700 round trip. Total trip time: 6-7 hours door to door.</p></div></div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-accent font-semibold shrink-0 w-20 text-sm">Mutianyu</span><div><p class="text-sm text-base-600 leading-relaxed">Take Bus 916 Express from Dongzhimen to Huairou (one hour), then a local taxi to Mutianyu (20 minutes). By private car, budget CNY 600-800 round trip. Most hotels can arrange a driver. Total trip time: 7-8 hours door to door.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-8 border-t border-base-200 pt-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Our Verdict by Traveler Type</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-base-200 rounded-lg">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead class="bg-base-100 text-base-500 uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">
          <tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">If you are...</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">Pick</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-left">Why</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">First-time China visitor</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Badaling</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Classic experience, easiest logistics</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">Traveling with kids</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Mutianyu</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Gentler slopes, cable car, toboggan slide</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">A photographer</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Mutianyu</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Forest backdrop, fewer people in frame</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">On a tight schedule</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Badaling</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Slightly faster, easier public transport</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">Visiting in autumn</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Mutianyu</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Golden and crimson forest foliage</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-b border-base-100"><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">Visiting in winter</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Badaling</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Fewer crowds, dramatic in snow</td></tr>
          <tr><td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-base-900">Hate crowds</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-accent font-medium">Mutianyu</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-base-600">Always fewer people, more peaceful</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
